  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Programmable (1LED/IC)"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Discover new possibilities with full-color programmable led strips. Customize every led to create stunning colors and adjust brightness to suit your mood. The USB controller comes with preset modes, but to access additional modes, a separate micro-controller board and software support are required, which are not included."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Ideal for DIY"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Experience the magic of effortless lighting with the included controller, choose from a wide range of patterns to make your led strip shine brightly and beautifully. No programming skills are needed if you are new."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Remote Control Instruction"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Click here to purchase a replacement for the remote control if you need one."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Considerations"
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Before making any modifications to the device, ensure that the LED strip is unplugged. Electrical currents can be dangerous and may result in electrical shock or injury in certain cases."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "The app has different versions that aren't compatible with each other. If there is no response when controlling the LED strip, please make sure you're using the correct app version."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "This product is not a toy. Please keep it out of reach of children."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "The bulbs are sealed and cannot be replaced."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Avoid immersing the lights in the fire."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Do not illuminate the lights while they are still inside the packaging."
    }
  ],
  "description_html": "<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-stpcic\"><!-- 第一条 -->\n<div class=\"pct_stpc-ic\"><!-- 左侧文案部分 -->\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\"></h3>\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\">Programmable (1LED/IC)</h3>\n<p class=\"pct_p\">Discover new possibilities with full-color programmable led strips. Customize every led to create stunning colors and adjust brightness to suit your mood. <br/>The USB controller comes with preset modes, but to access additional modes, a separate micro-controller board and software support are required, which are not included.</p>\n</div>\n<!-- 右侧图片部分 -->\n<div class=\"pct_ic\">\n<p style=\"margin-top: 30px;\"><video autoplay=\"autoplay\" class=\"product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--video bg-bbl-white animate-pulse aspect-video max-h-[400px]\" controls=\"controls\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-mce-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/f512828451f14afc8dd75b2a3a7cec43.mp4\" data-mce-style=\"width: 100%;\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/f512828451f14afc8dd75b2a3a7cec43.mp4\" height=\"150\" loop=\"loop\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/3c596c403dfd440990a80156fcc5282c.png\" style=\"width: 100%;\" width=\"300\"></video></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- 第二条 -->\n<div class=\"pct_stpc-ic\"><!-- 左侧文案部分 -->\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\"></h3>\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\"></h3>\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\">Ideal for DIY</h3>\n<div data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\" data-page-id=\"BBRnd3ZnMoheF1xBZCMcou9xnR4\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MwYVdBZPjoDc7mxOh7ucPqgwn6a\">Experience the magic of effortless lighting with the included controller, choose from a wide range of patterns to make your led strip shine brightly and beautifully. No programming skills are needed if you are new.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MwYVdBZPjoDc7mxOh7ucPqgwn6a\"></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Vx83du4dvo5ChZxT1OBc8e5onog\"></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line 